### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### Ask one question
POST http://localhost:3000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "What is an API, in one sentence?" }]
}

### Continue a conversation (the client sends the whole history)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "My name is Sita." },
    { "role": "assistant", "content": "Nice to meet you, Sita!" },
    { "role": "user", "content": "What is my name?" }
  ]
}

### Should fail with 400: last message is from the assistant
POST http://localhost:3000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [{ "role": "assistant", "content": "Hello" }]
}
